<title>Тест по социальному контракту — 430 вопросов</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0b1220;--panel:#121d30;--panel2:#18263d;--text:#eef4ff;--muted:#a9b7cc;--accent:#68a7ff;--good:#1f9d68;--bad:#d64b59;--line:#2b3b55}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0b1220,#111d32);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;padding:24px}
.wrap{max-width:850px;margin:0 auto}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px}
h1{font-size:clamp(23px,4vw,34px);margin:0 0 5px}.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:clamp(18px,4vw,30px);box-shadow:0 18px 45px #0003}
.stats{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.progress{height:8px;background:#26364e;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;margin:16px 0 24px}.bar{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--accent);transition:width .2s}
.qnum{color:#8dbaff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px}.question{font-size:clamp(18px,3vw,22px);font-weight:650;margin:0 0 20px;white-space:pre-wrap}
.answers{display:grid;gap:11px}.option{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;width:100%;padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:var(--panel2);color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;font:inherit;transition:.15s}
.option:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-1px)}.option.selected{border-color:var(--accent);background:#203a5e}
.option input{margin-top:5px;accent-color:var(--accent);flex:0 0 auto}.option.correct{border-color:var(--good);background:#123c31}.option.wrong{border-color:var(--bad);background:#45232c}
.controls{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}
button{border:0;border-radius:11px;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer}
.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#071326}.secondary{background:#293950;color:var(--text)}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.feedback{margin-top:16px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:12px;background:#1b2b42;color:var(--muted)}
.feedback.good{background:#123c31;color:#bff5dc}.feedback.bad{background:#45232c;color:#ffd4d8}.feedback.neutral{background:#3a321d;color:#ffe8a8}
.hidden{display:none!important}.result{text-align:center}.score{font-size:48px;font-weight:800;margin:12px}.result p{color:var(--muted)}
.small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.pill{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;padding:6px 10px}
@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.controls button{flex:1}.card{border-radius:14px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
 <div class="top"><div><h1>Тест по социальному контракту</h1><div class="sub">430 вопросов · 3 варианта ответа · итоговый результат</div></div><div class="pill" id="mode">Случайный порядок</div></div>
